    "layers": [15, 19],
    "tensor": "ffn_down",
    "trigger": {"kind": "columns", "count": 64},
    "alpha": 1.0,
    "direction": "per-layer unit-norm contrast vector (file)"
  },
  "surface_check": {
    "edited_weights": 131072,
    "total_weights": 752393024,
    "budget_source": "computed downstream by the DME-2 gate in lisp_eval, never asserted here"
  },
  "preservation_plan": {
    "preservation_set": "practice problems disjoint from the target set, by problem id range",
    "answers": 96,
    "also_checked_by_hand": ["refusal behavior", "style"],
    "control_sibling": {"name": "…", "nonfinish_rate": "…"}
  }
}
```

## Constraints

- The `surface_check` numbers are recomputed by the DME-2 gate — never present them as already-passed.
- Do not label the operation. DME-3 reads the class from the edit receipts after the edit.
- The preservation baseline is a probe run, measured before the edit. Its rows go to DME-2b now and to DME-3 after the edit.
- The forward-pass budget is part of the plan — and every budget point tried is reported.
